import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="What NoCostStack is and how it chooses the free alternatives it lists.">
  <h1>About NoCostStack</h1>
  <p>
    NoCostStack helps people and small teams find free and open-source alternatives to paid
    software. Each page explains what an alternative is best for and where its limits are, so you can
    decide before you switch.
  </p>
  <h2>How we choose what to list</h2>
  <p>
    We list tools that are genuinely free to use or have a free tier that is useful on its own. We
    note the limits so that you are not surprised later. Software changes often, so always check the
    tool's own website for current terms.
  </p>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>If something here is out of date or wrong, please tell us so we can fix it.</p>
</Base>
